Package: deft-pro-configurator
Version: 1.0.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: DEFT Pro Configurator Contributors <your-email@example.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, python3-evdev, udev
Description: GUI configurator and remapper for the Elecom DEFT Pro trackball
 A GTK desktop application for configuring the Elecom DEFT Pro on Ubuntu/Linux.
 Supports mouse buttons, keyboard keys/hotkeys, shell commands, profiles,
 background remapping through evdev/uinput, and automatic startup.
